        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 9125-RC, 2-1/2\" Full Lip Extended Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2\" radius corner lip strike plate is for use with tubular entry locks, passage sets, and privacy sets. It is especially handy for custom installations. The full lip extended strike plate has a 2-1/2 inch lip and a 3 inch overall length with a 2-1/4 inch width. It comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in other sizes:  <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-lip-radius-corner-strike-plate-don-jo-9115-rc\">1-1/2 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-3-4-inch-lip-radius-corner-strike-plate-don-jo-9175-rc\">1-3/4 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-9125-RC-size.gif?v=1704354777\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Replacement Radius Corner Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin stainless steel, matte black and the dark bronze finishes have a stainless steel base metal. The polished brass, antique brass and satin nickel  finishes have a brass base metal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 9125-RC Full Lip Door Strike Plate with Radius Corners:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Radius (Rounded)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-9125-RC.pdf?v=1704262399\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 9125-RC Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
